#!/usr/bin/env python3
# =============================================================
# Author:  TechOGR
# Repo:    https://github.com/TechOGR/bspwm_dotfiles_arch
#
# ThemeCursor - an animated cursor theme drawn for every rice theme.
#
#   ThemeCursor <style> [--size 32] [--anim full|calm|off] [bg=#rrggbb fg=... ...]
#   ThemeCursor --sheet out.png       (a preview of every style)
#
#   ✔ One look per theme (cyber, pixel, snake, halloween, samurai,
#     steampunk, graffiti...) in the colors of the palette in use, plus
#     extra styles of their own
#     (aurora, galaxy, rgb, frost, gold, matrix, sakura, plasma, comet,
#     ocean, vortex, firefly, prism, love, circuit, synthwave)
#   ✔ Rounded triangle pointer (Bibata like), every cursor animated:
#     pointer, hand, text, help, crosshair, busy, progress, move, resize
#   ✔ Any size (24 - 96), animation full, calm (slower) or off
#   ✔ The rest is inherited from Bibata-Modern-Classic
#   ✔ Written straight to Xcursor files (no xcursorgen), cached: it is
#     only drawn again when the theme or its colors change
#
# Prints the name of the cursor theme (~/.icons/Rice-Cursor-<kit>-<hash>).
# config/modules/03-gtk.sh runs it when gtk_cursor="Rice-Animated".
#
# Copyright (C) 2021-2026 TechOGR <https://github.com/TechOGR>
# Licensed under GPL-3.0 license
# =============================================================

